  "spectral": {
    "true_color": "High confidence: vegetated fields are medium to dark green, woodland is generally dark green with coarse tonal variation, and sparsely vegetated parcels are tan or cream. Narrow routes are pale gray-green. The central curved margin is distinctly lighter green than adjacent fields.",
    "false_color": "High confidence: many open vegetated parcels are vivid red, while woodland ranges from dark maroon to brighter mottled red. Pale agricultural strips appear cyan, gray-green or muted pink. The curved central margin is pink-red, supporting a vegetation component.",
